1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
this is the normal afternoon

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
pay again for the same context

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
and then the run stops

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
three problems. one address. that is all routre does

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,500
the same session, sent twice

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,000
point your agent at one address

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,500
