9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,500
ask twice, pay once

10
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:53,500
busy provider, next provider

11
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:58,000
measured, not promised

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
see every token

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
